# Symlink manifest — one "<source> <target>" mapping per line.
#
# <source> is repo-relative (no leading / ~ $) OR an absolute/~/$VAR path.
# Copy this to a new *.conf and adjust. See README.md for details.
#
# In-repo source (repo-relative, survives moving/cloning the repo):
local/claude/settings.json             ~/.claude/settings.json
#
# External source (absolute / ~ / $VAR), e.g. work files outside the repo:
#~/Documents/YourOrg/Development/env    ~/.config/yourorg/env
